+
+/*
+ Most of this file is a port of the reference implementation that
+ accompanies P. Jäckel, "Let's Be Rational", Wilmott (2015), pp. 40-53
+ (www.jaeckel.org/LetsBeRational.7z, revision 990), which carries the
+ following notice:
+
+ ======================================================================================
